        "Content": "3 Bed Duplex   Type E2    123 sq.m (1,324 sq.ft)   From €395,000\r\n\r\nSeven Winds is a luxurious collection of newly constructed modern 2, 3 & 4 bedroom homes on North Road, Drogheda, Co. Louth.\r\n\r\nWith a mix of homes finished to the highest standard, this development brings modern urban living in a peaceful setting. Nestled neatly between the bustling historic town of Drogheda, adjacent countryside and with superior access to the Dublin-Belfast commuter route, these spacious, light filled homes are in the ideal location for residents at all stages of life.\r\n\r\nSeven Winds radiates character, style and space. The vibrant town of Drogheda, and the surrounding hinterland, has an abundance of social, cultural, natural and sporting amenities. Such variety caters for a high quality lifestyle. Within walking distance of Drogheda Town Centre, residents will find a choice of boutiques, high street stores, restaurants, book shops, bars and artisan cafes. The town and surrounding area boast of various sports clubs; rowing, GAA, soccer, rugby, basketball, badminton, tennis and world class golf courses. The coastline is less than 10 minutes’ drive away. With several parks, cycle ways and walking trails close by, leisure pursuits outdoors are there to be enjoyed.\r\n\r\nResidents of Seven Winds also have several national schools and secondary schools, under diverse patronage close by. For adult learners, Drogheda Institute of Further Education has a wide range of third level opportunities. The bustling town is rich with heritage and culture. There are numerous historic sites and cultural centres within the town and nearby. These include Millmount Museum & Craft Quarter, Battle of the Boyne Museum, Mellifont Abbey, Newgrange Visitor Centre, Droichead Arts Centre and Highlanes Gallery.\r\n\r\nConveniently situated on the north side of Drogheda, Seven Winds offers easy access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City and the M1, M50 motorways. With excellent intercity bus & rail links within minutes walking or cycling distance, Seven Winds offers relaxed modern urban living, with quick access to commuter links when there’s a need to commute.\r\n\r\nApollo 7 Group is committed to building superior quality homes. Using quality materials and design, we will ensure each new home is finished to the highest standard. Seven Winds residential development has been designed carefully by a team of outstanding , with the goal of delivering modern urban living, adjacent to all the amenities necessary for living well.\r\nWe offer A rated homes with leading market specifications and well-proportioned spacious designs.\r\n\r\nThe development also boasts landscaped communal green areas. Located on the perimeter of the historic town of Drogheda, Seven Winds residents have a vast array of amenities on their doorstep. Within walking distance of Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital & Drogheda Town Centre, residents have cinemas, a Library, a Museum, an Arts Centre and a Gallery only minutes from their homes. Sporting clubs and amenities are plentiful in Drogheda and the surrounding areas.\r\nWe are proud to present this scheme to the market, building homes and a community for high quality modern life.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\nSuperior Low Energy Design\r\n• “A2” BER energy rating\r\n• Low energy, low carbon houses\r\n• Very high levels of insulation incorporated in floors, walls, and roofs\r\n• Super warm construction delivering exceptionally high levels of thermal performance and air tightness\r\n• High performance, low U-Value windows, and external doors\r\n• Central heating system using highly efficient A-Rated Air to Water Heat Pump\r\n• Thermostatically controlled heating downstairs and upstairs\r\n• Demand Control Ventilation system to meet updated building control regulations\r\n• The internal water supply is a pressurised system\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTimber Frame Construction\r\nClosed Panel “Lifestyle” wall system from DTE designed to not only meet but exceed the latest building regulations with a variation in external brick elevations.\r\n\r\nEfficient Low-Energy Design\r\nThe houses at Seven Winds enjoy many features designed to lessen energy demand and to reduce the cost of heating and hot water production.\r\n\r\nWindows\r\nFuture proof, Double glazed extremely efficient thermal performance with insulation levels to meet building requirements for decades to come.\r\n\r\nInsulation\r\nCarefully designed and detailed to reduce heat loss through floors, walls, and roofs with superior levels of insulation.\r\n\r\nAirtightness\r\nPerfectly airtight with optimum indoor air quality and thermal comfort all year round including a demand control ventilation system to meet building regulation requirements.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHeating\r\nHeating made easy with highly efficient A-Rated Integrated Split Air to Water Heat Pump.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBuilding Guarantee:\r\nQuality homes are covered by the Homebond 10-year Guarantee Scheme.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKitchen & Wardrobe\r\n• Elegant high quality fitted kitchens with contemporary countertop and island unit as per showhouse\r\n• Fitted Wardrobes throughout as standard\r\n• Fitted storage units to utility room\r\n• White goods Package included as standard – Built in Double oven, hob, Fridge freezer, dishwasher, microwave and extractor hood as per showhouse\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBathrooms & En-suites\r\n• Stylish bathroom with attractive high-quality sanitary ware and fittings\r\n• Bathroom and en-suite wet areas and floors tiled as per showhouse\r\n• Master bedroom En-suite fitted with large walk-in shower area.\r\n• Master bedroom En-suite fitted with vanity unit hand basin\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInternal Finishes\r\n• Internal walls plastered and painted throughout\r\n• Smoke, heat, and CO2 detectors fitted as standard.\r\n• Wired for intruder alarm and cable television throughout\r\n• CAT 6 cable wiring for data and telephone points for high-speed SIRO broadband connection\r\n• Standard light fittings and attractive power points\r\n• Contemporary MDF skirting and architraves\r\n• Elegant white solid shaker style internal doors with chrome lever handles, locks, and hinges\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nExternal Finishes\r\n• Low maintenance attractive brick and coloured monochue render finishes\r\n• Coin stone detail of true craftsmanship around windows and doors in brick finish\r\n• Granite Silver cobble-locked driveways with parking for 2 cars\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGardens\r\n• Gardens are top soiled and seeded\r\n• Outdoor tap and external double power socket are a very practical solution to your outdoor needs\r\n• Green areas landscaped to a high standard throughout development\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nViewing Details\r\n\r\nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFor more information, visit www.sevenwinds.ie"
      },
